Package: causalmiss
Type: Package
Title: Small Tools for Causal Discovery with Incomplete Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Yuqi", "Qiu", email = "yqqiu@fem.ecnu.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a small, dependency-light implementation of selected
    components from three manuscripts on causal discovery with missing data.
    Includes Gaussian conditional independence tests, stable skeleton search,
    source-aware multiple imputation, pooled tests, graph-guided imputation,
    and lag-window construction. The first version targets small continuous
    datasets and documents the scope of each implementation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, graphics, utils
URL: https://github.com/yuqi77/causalmiss
BugReports: https://github.com/yuqi77/causalmiss/issues
NeedsCompilation: no

